        {
          "head_sequence": 6,
          "user_text": "今天先聊点新的：圆形和方形，哪个更容易让你想到安静？",
          "user_language": "zh",
          "assistant_text": "我大概会选圆形。弧线没有尖角，视线顺着走一圈也不会被拦住，那种感觉更接近安静。方形也有它的安稳，但四个角像在提醒你「这里有边界」，安静里会多一点秩序感。你是更偏向哪一种？",
          "assistant_language": "zh",
          "published_at_us": 1790914822957211,
          "outcome_summary": {
            "living_memory_status": "no-op",
            "living_memory_recalled_count": 0,
            "memory_content": null,
            "knowledge_status": null,
            "knowledge_citation_ids": [],
            "relationship_status": null,
            "relationship_candidate_event": null,
            "participant_goal_commitment_status": null,
            "participant_goal_commitment_action": null,
            "participant_goal_commitment_selected_count": 0,
            "situated_state_status": null,
            "situated_state_action": null,
            "situated_state_posture": null,
            "situated_state_reason_code": null,
            "medium_state_status": null,
            "medium_state_baseline": null,
            "medium_state_before_baseline": null,
            "medium_state_reason_code": null,
            "medium_state_signal": null,
            "memory_revision": false,
            "preference_question": null,
            "memory_withdrawal_status": null
          }
        },
        {
          "head_sequence": 7,
          "user_text": "你刚才为什么选它？",
          "user_language": "zh",
          "assistant_text": "刚才选圆形，是因为它更接近我理解的那种“安静”：没有尖角，也没有明确的起点终点，视线可以慢慢绕一圈，像呼吸一样不被打断。方形当然也安静，但它先让我看见四条边和四个角，安静里带着一点被安排好的秩序。所以如果只问“更容易想到”，我会把圆形放前面。",
          "assistant_language": "zh",
          "published_at_us": 1790914833657831,
          "outcome_summary": {
            "living_memory_status": "no-op",
            "living_memory_recalled_count": 0,
